    "title": "The Village Green breaks ground on new restrooms - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Mitch Stone reporter@highlandsnews.com ,\n17 hours ago Brandy Letson, chair of The Village Green Board of Directors; Nick Breedlove, executive director of the Jackson County Tourism Development Authority; Marty Reid of Reid’s Construction; Dale Gordon; Taylor Bruce, Peter Young and Lea Thompson of The Village Green Board of Directors; and Jesse Cunningham of CCSV Gives pose with shovels during the groundbreaking ceremony. — The Village Green broke ground on its new restrooms Monday, Oct. 12, near the playground entrance off U.S. Highway 64. The old restrooms were demolished during the ceremony. Read full article",
